I don't know.

4
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:56,000
Oh, Asuna, I've turned into
the biggest crybaby, haven't I?

5
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,840
The feeling is rising,

6
00:02:03,940 --> 00:02:07,980
It's a true promise to me.

7
00:02:19,760 --> 00:02:23,337
A miracle that I want,

8
00:02:23,420 --> 00:02:24,297
To be

9
